      "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
      "body": "The docker compose file for the Marlowe Starter Kit does not include an image with the `marlowe-oracle` executable. Neither does it expose the ports required to use `marlowe-oracle` externally. See https://discord.com/channels/826816523368005654/936295815926927390/1152019747370700943 for more details.\r\n\r\n:point_right: Add docker support and documentation for `marlowe-oracle` into the starter kit.",
